cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, and also cite the paper (in preparation)."
title: "Hybrid LSTM for daily Northern Hemisphere snow water equivalent"
abstract: >-
  Code to train and evaluate a hybrid LSTM that predicts daily snow water
  equivalent from meteorological and topographic predictors and ERA5-Land SWE,
  trained on in situ SWE from the NH-SWE dataset, and to compare it with a
  plain data-driven LSTM and ERA5-Land.
type: software
authors:
